menu "Lummiss heap diagnostics"
    config H264_FRAGMENT_FOCUSED
        bool "Enable bounded reserve-region owner diagnosis"
        default y
        help
            Trace until first H264 open. Print at most 12 owner groups and
            16 boundary allocations, without the complete heap dump.
    config H264_FRAGMENT_VERBOSE
        bool "Enable one-shot full H264 heap layout and allocation trace"
        default n
        help
            Diagnostic only. Prints hundreds of heap blocks and allocation
            callers before the first H264 open. Keep disabled for normal use.
endmenu
